      "review_summary": "The branch bounds browser CDP JSON HTTP reads at 16 MiB, updates one helper mock, adds a local proof script, and also changes unrelated LLM/gateway test and type surfaces.\n\nPR surface: Source +27, Tests +91. Total +118 across 9 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. from source inspection: current main uses raw response.json() for central CDP JSON reads, and a local HTTP server returning more than 16 MiB would exercise the unbounded path. I did not execute that proof in this read-only review.",
